The Amidah blessing for healing is called Refa’einu (“Heal us”). Here is a clear English version:

Amidah – Prayer for Healing (Refa’einu)

Heal us, Lord, and we shall be healed;
save us, and we shall be saved,
for You are our praise.

Grant complete healing for all our afflictions.
Blessed are You, Lord,
who heals the sick of His people Israel.

==============================================================
Slightly expanded traditional-style translation:

Heal us, O Lord, and we shall be healed;
save us and we shall be saved, for You are our praise.

Bring complete healing to all our wounds,
for You are God, King, the faithful and compassionate healer.

Blessed are You, Lord,
who heals the sick of His people Israel.

This blessing is often said with special intention for those who are ill, sometimes adding personal names in prayer.

